@@ -41,6 +41,10 @@
 | Feature | Notes |
 |---------|-------|
 | FSDP2 / HSDP | Decoder sharded per layer; vision encoder sharded as a separate unit |
+| Tensor Parallelism (TP) | Head-parallel KDA and MLA with sequence parallel; the latent MoE uses core's expert sharding; the vision encoder uses the MoonViT plan shared with Kimi K2.5 |
+| Expert Parallelism (EP) | Grouped experts on core's token dispatcher; composes with FSDP2 and TP (the B200 CI cell `kimi_k3_debugmodel_mm` runs FSDP2 x TP2 x EP2 with sequence parallel) |
+
+Pipeline parallelism and context parallelism are not supported yet; `parallelize_kimi_k3` refuses them.
 
